      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The dragon magnifies the intuition of another creature it can see within 60 feet of itself. That creature can't be Surprised, has Advantage on Wisdom checks and saving throws, and can hear and understand the surface thoughts of creatures within 15 feet of it. These benefits last for 1 hour, until the dragon becomes Incapacitated, or until the dragon takes this Bonus Action again.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
