        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The dragon shape-shifts into a Medium humanoid (of an appearance of its choice), or it returns to its true draconic form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. The dragon chooses whether any equipment it's wearing is dropped, worn, or merged with its form when it shape-shifts.</p>",
